# Build context for api/Dockerfile (the sponsor image) — the only root-context build in this repo.
# Deny everything, then re-admit exactly the two homes that image reads: the sponsor sources and the
# canonical release.json it bakes its PTB-scope allowlist from. A path ladder is required because a
# "!" exception cannot re-admit a file whose parent directory is still excluded.
*
!api
!packages
packages/*
!packages/sdk
packages/sdk/*
!packages/sdk/src
packages/sdk/src/*
!packages/sdk/src/deployment

# Never, whatever the ladder above re-admits.
**/node_modules
